{"name":"Top Nav","description":"Place the main navigation across the top of the page · A top-navigation layout works when a product has a small number of primary sections and needs wide content space below. Keep labels short, show the current section, and decide how the navigation collapses on narrow screens. Know first Navbar Sticky","quote":"Use the classic layout: a navigation bar on top and all the content below it.","agentPrompt":"Use a top-navigation layout for the content site: put brand, five primary destinations, and search in the top bar, constrain article width, and collect secondary entries on mobile. Verify current-page state, long titles, and sticky offset.","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-top-nav-layout\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>Top Nav</h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">You might say</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">Use the classic layout: a navigation bar on top and all the content below it.</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">Place the main navigation across the top of the page</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>A top-navigation layout works when a product has a small number of primary sections and needs wide content space below. Keep labels short, show the current section, and decide how the navigation collapses on narrow screens.</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"Know first\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">Know first</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/navbar?lang=en\" data-ref=\"navbar\">Navbar</a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/sticky?lang=en\" data-ref=\"sticky\">Sticky</a></div></div></div><div class=\"dh-demo responsive-detail-demo diagram-detail-demo\" style=\"--detail-demo-width:400px\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"topnav-wire\">\n    <div class