gin:0 auto\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Content that needs full page width</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><span style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:14px;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2)\">Top bar · position: sticky</span><div class=\"mk-skel\" style=\"top:6px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:65%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:72%\"></i></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Simple cross-page navigation</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row between\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:40%\"></i><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">Create project</span></div><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>When NOT to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Squeeze many deep sections into one row</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:3px\"><span style=\"padding:1px 5px;border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);white-space:nowrap\">Home</span><span style=\"padding:1px 5px;border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);white-space:nowrap\">Product</span><span style=\"padding:1px 5px;border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);white-space:nowrap\">Approach</span><span style=\"padding:1px 5px;border:1px solid var(--red);border-radiu